  352 2ADE ~            ; quotient's bits gather in C and go to qr a byte at a time, from the top: fifty-six of them, bits
  353 2ADE ~            ; 63 to 8, the fifty-three of the result and three below, and what remains then is the sticky bit,
  354 2ADE ~            ; at bit 0 -- the round bit is bit 10, and everything below it counts only as not zero. The
  355 2ADE ~            ; comparison, the subtraction and the shift are written out, not called: three times as fast.
