 4123 2ADE ~            ; DE:HL shifted right by C, 1 to 31, with B -- 00h or the sign's FFh -- coming in at the top: both
 4124 2ADE ~            ; right shifts of a long. Eight places at a time by moving the bytes, B the new top one, worked out
 4125 2ADE ~            ; once rather than at each byte. What is left, 1 to 7 places: 1 to 3 a bit a step, the top bit
 4126 2ADE ~            ; from B's; 4 to 7 as 8 - n steps to the left with B as a fifth byte above D, and the bytes moved
 4127 2ADE ~            ; down by one -- 67 T-states a step against 107 to the right (ivagor's way for a word,
 4128 2ADE ~            ; zx-pk.ru #77, and his two ways in for the sign, #92: here one way in, the sign held in B).
 4129 2ADE ~            ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
